                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Description = Bounder integrator keeps min <= f(x) <= max. \nIf min or max are crossed, keeps f(x) constant (ignores f' and sets f'(x)=0 until f' changes)\nTo change the QSS method go into the coupled model (tested with QSS1 and 2)
